  "findings": [
    {
      "level": "native-confirmed",
      "claim": "官方确有共同BasicTalent组件协议和Unit.talents成员；UnitMode另持模式天赋数组。统一入口包括AssignData/Attach/Detach以及攻击/复活/回收虚方法。",
      "anchors": [
        77702,
        77703,
        77844,
        73301,
        73304,
        73305
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "native-confirmed",
      "claim": "Character._AssignData按序调用_PreprocessTalents、_PreprocessSkill、_AssignSkill、_AssignTalents、_AssignTrait；_AssignTalents用skillIndex资格和按talentKey查询的talentMap判定，成功调用虚AssignData，失败MarkInvalid。BasicTalent.isValid普通实现检查data非空。",
      "anchors": [
        76054,
        76062,
        73274
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "native-confirmed",
      "claim": "Character.OnInit在Unit.OnInit之后逐天赋CheckRootOrValidModeTalent，满足才Attach；它在OnBorn之前具备附着入口。OnBorn本身经Unit注册、common/dynamic Ability附着和owner-post-born Buff事件；AppearTalent子类另按born或locate配置触发CastDirectly。不能把所有Talent等同onEnter一次安装。",
      "anchors": [
        76025,
        76027,
        77696,
        73269,
        73270
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "native-confirmed",
      "claim": "BasicTalent.AssignData向内部Ability.SetData；基础DoAttach/DoDetach委托Ability.Attach/Detach；BasicTalent.isAttached读取Ability.isAttached。Attach保存owner后调DoAttach；Detach先DoDetach再清owner。data有效性与当前participation不同。",
